===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Champion's Path|Vulpix|6}} from the {{TCG|Champion's Path}} expansion.
*'''Live Coal''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Mysterious Treasures|Cyndaquil|79}} from the {{TCG|Mysterious Treasures}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

